 "text": "Hi, how you doing these days? I use a basket on the front or a backpack on the back. The basket gives you hands free for the groceries, while the backpack doesn't slow you down. They' quite sturdy, and many bikes come with one as well. You can usually fit lot more than you'd think. A backpack is more versatile, and you can stack multiple layers of bags inside it, so it feels like quite a load. Some people find them uncomfortable, especially if they lean forward. A good quality pack with wide comfort band helps a lot.",
